					<![CDATA[
						 <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3290685&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607434270" alt="Rye Travis" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3290685)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" >Rye Travis</a></span>，以及他留在这个网站上的全部。</p> <hr /> <p>这是原创。他在努力让这个乏善可陈的清单变得更长。</p> <div style="display: {$show-scp}"> <p><strong>SCP：</strong></p> </div> <div style="display: {$show-tale}"> <p><strong>故事：</strong></p> </div> <div style="display: {$show-tale}"> <p><strong>杂项：</strong></p> </div> <hr /> <p>这是翻译。他的水平堪忧，随时都等着回来重新修缮。</p> <p><strong>SCP：</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/weryllium-proposal">代号：Palanez博士的提案</a> - “执子之手”</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-025-j">SCP-025-J</a> - SCP基金会之水</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-521-ko">SCP-521-KO</a> - 看到什么了？</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-666-jp-j">SCP-666-JP-J</a> - 究极恐怖物体</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1-800-j">SCP-1-800-J</a> - 供应有限</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3779">SCP-3779</a> - 温室：或，D-80801是如何学会屈服并拥抱自然的</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/old:scp-3928">SCP-3928（旧）</a> - 唯遗忘是真正的死亡</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4070">SCP-4070</a> - 仅是他所思之物</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4597">SCP-4597</a> - 厚皮男</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4663">SCP-4663</a> - 3D打印蜘蛛打印打印机打印蜘蛛打印机打印蜘蛛打印打印蜘蛛打印机</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/old:scp-5432">SCP-5432（旧）</a> - 要有光亮</li> </ul> <p><strong>故事：</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/spark-of-wonder">奇迹的火花</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/spark-of-creation">创造的火花</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-173-d">SCP-173-D</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/several-clever-promotions">几种创意宣传</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/empathy">同情</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/life-itself">生命本质</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/field-man">田间人</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/i-don-t-want-to-bee-alone">我不愿独自一人</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/stuck-in-the-past">纠结过去</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/its-the-end-of-the-world-as-you-know-it">如你所知的世界末日（而且我感觉良好）</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/microwave">微波炉</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/new-job">最新工作</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/from-unknown-admirer-to-unknown-admiree">从未知的倾慕者到未知的受倾慕者</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/don-t-let-the-fire-die">（别）让火熄了</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/urine-over-your-head">尿太深奥</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/who-remembers-the-forgotten">谁人铭记被遗忘者</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/find-your-way-back-home">找寻归家之路</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/ars-gratia-artis">为艺术而艺术</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/ex-nihilo-nihil">自始至终，一无是处</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/recurrence">再现</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/observations">观察报告</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/happy-father-s-day">父亲节快乐</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>艺作：</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-devourer">吞噬者</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/hasuma-monochromeartworks">单色艺术作品</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/doors">门</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/caged-bird-and-bird-cage">笼中之鸟与缚鸟之笼</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/artes-in-completas-de-silvacrest">Silvacrest完整的艺术作品</a></li> <li><a href="http:/