&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-212718-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. 同上。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-212718-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. 遗传自母族。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-212718-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. 即Site-CN-91。&lt;/div&gt;
